{"id":"s1.5.4","slug":"a-b-plus-b-a-trick","title":"a/b + b/a Trick","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">When adding a fraction and its reciprocal, $\\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{b}{a}$, you can use the formula:</p><p class=\"text-center font-bold mb-4\">$\\frac{a}{b} + \\frac{b}{a} = 2 + \\frac{(a-b)^2}{ab}$</p><p>For example, $\\frac{5}{7} + \\frac{7}{5} = 2 + \\frac{(7-5)^2}{7 \\cdot 5} = 2 + \\frac{4}{35} = 2\\frac{4}{35}$.</p><p>A popular variation involves a slight modification, like $\\frac{11}{13} + \\frac{2}{11}$. This can be rewritten as $(\\frac{11}{13} + \\frac{13}{11}) - \\frac{11}{11}$, allowing you to use the trick and then adjust the result.</p>","summary":"When adding a fraction and its reciprocal, , you can use the formula: For example, .","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem involving the sum of a fraction and its reciprocal.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{12}{13} + \\frac{13}{12}$. (mixed number)","answer":"2 1/156","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{5}{6} + \\frac{6}{5}$. (mixed number)","answer":"2 1/30","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{15}{19} + \\frac{19}{15}$. (mixed number)","answer":"2 16/285","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{3}{5} + \\frac{5}{3} - 2$.","answer":"4/15","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{7}{5} + \\frac{5}{7} - 1$. (mixed number)","answer":"1 4/35","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{11}{13} + \\frac{2}{11}$. (mixed number)","answer":"1 4/143","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{7}{13} + \\frac{6}{7}$. (mixed number)","answer":"1 36/91","kind":"exact","requiredForm":"mixed","tags":["fractions"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $\\frac{5}{6} + 1\\frac{1}{5} - 2$.","answer":"1/30","kind":"exact","t